== global_allocator_args
error: malformed `global_allocator` attribute input
 --> <global_allocator_args>:1:1
  |
1 | #[global_allocator(x)] static A: System = System;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
help: must be of the form
  |
1 - #[global_allocator(x)] static A: System = System;
1 + #[global_allocator] static A: System = System;
  |

